Dashboard

RynoX currently runs as a standalone Discord bot.

The web dashboard system and its API backend have been removed. Bot functionality is handled directly through Discord.

Security

- Never share your Discord bot token.
- Never upload your real ".env" file to GitHub.
- Use environment variables for private credentials.
- Keep webhook URLs and API keys private.

Important: Add ".env" to ".gitignore" before publishing your repository. Use a ".env.example" containing placeholders instead.

